    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the cabin floor seat track runs, the splice plates and the floor beam clips, covering the galley and lavatory zones where corrosion repairs are concentrated.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the cabin floor seat track sections, the splice plates, the floor beam clips and the fastener hardware in the forward galley and aft lavatory zones.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn for the left side of the cabin; the right side is a mirror image with the same part numbers except for the handed clip at item 30. Track sections are supplied in fixed lengths and a run is made up from several sections, so the item quantities depend on the cabin layout. A run may not carry more splices than the limit given in the repair instructions."
    },
